msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/teacherFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "teacher is functional"
msgstr "teacher 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/teacherFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:teacher is functional: one gmeow:Teaching relator has exactly one instructing agent — co-teaching is several Teaching relators sharing a subject and learner set, never two teachers on one relation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:teacher 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Teaching 关系体恰好有一位授课主体——协同教学表现为多个共享同一学科与学习者集合的 Teaching 关系体,而绝不是在一个关系上出现两位教师。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/teacherFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:teacher names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:teacher 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/teacherFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/teacherFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:teacher, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:teacher, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/teacherFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:teacherFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:teacher ."
msgstr "gmeow:teacherFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:teacher ."
